


>> CoffeeMachine := ବସ୍ତୁ ନୂତନ.
CoffeeMachine ଯେବେ: ['order:'] କର: { :id
	>> coffee := ['Americano'].
	( id = 1 ) ସତ୍ୟ-ହେଲେ: {
		coffee := ['Cappuccino'].
	}.
	( id = 2 ) ସତ୍ୟ-ହେଲେ: {
		coffee := ['Espresso'].
	}.
	( id = 3 ) ସତ୍ୟ-ହେଲେ: {
		coffee := ['Latte'].
	}. <- coffee.
}.
>> SimpleCoffeeMachine := ବସ୍ତୁ ନୂତନ.
SimpleCoffeeMachine ଯେବେ: ['order'] କର: { <- ['Black']. }.
>> redCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: redCup, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.
redCup := ['Tea']. 
>> greenCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: greenCup, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.
>> yellowCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: yellowCup, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.
>> blueCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: blueCup, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.
>> plasticCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
plasticCup := ['Lemonade']. 
>> blackCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: blackCup, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.
blackCup ଶେଷରେ-ଯୋଡ଼: [' nooo.... beer. '].
>> orangeCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ ଲେଖ: orangeCup, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.
